OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by car in Lidl crash
OL,4,Awas inside store
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 30s was inside a Lidl
OL,7,Fstore when he was killed by a car that
OL,8,Fcrashed through the entrance in
OL,9,FWolverhampton, an ambulance service has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe man was pronounced dead at the
OL,13,Fscene after the crash, which West
OL,14,FMidlands Ambulance Service was called
OL,15,Fto just before 18:00 BST on Friday.
OL,17,FThe service said the woman who was
OL,18,Fdriving the car is believed to have had
OL,19,Fa medical incident at the wheel. She
OL,20,Fwas treated at the scene before being
OL,21,Ftaken to hospital for further
OL,22,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
